<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's ALUAR $150 mln bond issue okayed-Bolsa.</title>
<headline>Argentina's ALUAR $150 mln bond issue okayed-Bolsa.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine aluminum refiner Aluminio Argentino SAIC (ALUAR)  was authorized to issue $150 million worth of floating rate bonds guaranteed by export credits, the Buenos Aires Stock Exchange said Friday.</p>
<p>The bonds will mature on June 10, 2004 and will accrue monthly interest.</p>
<p>((--Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650))</p>
